{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>TVB藝人俞可程（Kanis）早前被爆疑與導演在街頭舉止親暱，令其一直以來在戀愛綜藝節目《女神配對計劃2》中建 …</p><p></p>\n<p>TVB藝人俞可程（Kanis）早前被爆疑與導演在街頭舉止親暱，令其一直以來在戀愛綜藝節目《女神配對計劃2》中建立的「單身女神」形象一夕崩塌。繼早前被臨時飛出TVB台慶大騷後，昨晚（22日）播出的《女神配對計劃2》第12集中，原本預告會播出她與「求愛勇者」侯建民（Zico）在主題樂園進行單獨約會、坐海盜船及互送禮物的畫面，最終亦遭製作組緊急「一刀切」全數刪走，連帶與她配對的Zico亦受牽連「被消失」。</p>\n<h2>內地版驚現「漏網之魚」 完整樂園約會網上瘋傳</h2>\n<p>正當香港觀眾以為該集片段已成「絕響」之際，有網民卻在社交平台Threads驚爆，內地播放平台（如B站）竟意外流出了未經刪減的原版內容！有網民上載了內地版的錄屏片段，顯示俞可程與Zico到主題樂園遊玩、齊坐纜車以及單獨受訪的畫面均被完整保留，畫面彈幕甚至有網民打出「好慘的男人」字眼。另有細心網民發現兩地剪輯版本大不同，香港電視版刪走了俞可程與Zico的片段，而內地原版則保留了二人約會，反而刪去了另一女神陳星妤（Yvette）的樂園約會，僅留下按摩活動部分。<br/>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179540413115147627_5330182926b03b164421a3.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"螢幕截圖 2026-11-23 上午11.13.26.png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179540413115147627_5330182926b03b164421a3.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：bilibili）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>網民睇完一面倒鬧爆「超作狀」 大讚製作組：好在Cut咗！</h2>\n<p>隨著約會片段在網上瘋傳，不少網民觀看後非但沒有覺得可惜，反而紛紛留言大讚TVB製作組刪走片段是「明智之舉」，直言「好在Cut咗」，免得香港觀眾睇到火滾。網民在討論區及社交平台熱烈留言，一面倒狠批俞可程在片中表現極度造作、刻意放電。不少網民直指她在約會時語氣與平時做訪問判若兩人，紛紛留言鬧爆「Kanis把聲好鬼作狀、好鬼難聽」、「堅反感，聽到把聲人都燥埋！消失啦」、「聽返佢平時同人訪問嘅聲真係差好遠，呢把聲勁姣」，更有人模仿其語氣嘲諷「監製好粗暴人家巧怕怕」，並細數她「不停翹耳仔頭髮同玩髮尾都好作狀」，直言「超姣、超作狀」。 亦有網民重提她被爆緋聞一事，留言諷刺「姣到咁，終於明點解Ocamp會有15隻狗公DM佢」、「遇到這種女，馬上逃離」、「冇用，條女明玩嘢」、「玩弄感情」，甚至有人質疑節目「所有嘢跟劇本走，做戲」。\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179540413654177066_13880806026b03b16906a43.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"螢幕截圖 2026-11-23 上午11.15.53.png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179540413654177066_13880806026b03b16906a43.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：bilibili）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179540414181392619_18789197836b03b16e771c7.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"螢幕截圖 2026-11-23 上午11.16.26.png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179540414181392619_18789197836b03b16e771c7.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：bilibili）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179540414680978472_5561765736b03b1735055d.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"螢幕截圖 2026-11-23 上午11.14.59.png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179540414680978472_5561765736b03b1735055d.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：bilibili）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>網民一面倒心痛Zico 揭「定情公仔」放舖頭珍藏極虐心</h2>\n<p>在一片罵聲之中，男方Zico卻贏得網民一面倒的同情，紛紛封他為「悲慘男人Zico」。觀眾大讚「Zico真係好好」，在約會過程中表現真誠貼心，卻無辜受女方緋聞牽連導致鏡頭全被刪走，令不少網民替他大感不值，留言安慰：「My tears ah Zico」、「Zico你盡情發洩啦」。更令網民感到「虐心」的是，有眼利粉絲從流出的纜車約會截圖中發現，俞可程當時在纜車上曾送贈一隻小公仔給Zico，而Zico事後竟然將該公仔珍而重之地擺放在自己開設的店舖內展示！真相曝光後，網民紛紛大呼心碎，留言痛斥：「仲要放喺舖頭珍而重之？！好虐心喎！」、「其實佢哋好襯，可惜Kanis唔識珍惜」、「我接受唔到Zico又遇到個咁嘅女仔，又出軌」，替一片真心的Zico感到極度可憐。\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179540415382188521_2210296746b03b17a23d91.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"WhatsApp Image 2026-11-23 at 11.17.53.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179540415382188521_2210296746b03b17a23d91.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：threads）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179540415560287249_11965881146b03b17c36b14.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"螢幕截圖 2026-11-23 上午11.14.37.png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179540415560287249_11965881146b03b17c36b14.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：bilibili）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179540416292838038_18952633786b03b18357085.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"螢幕截圖 2026-11-23 上午11.15.32.png/2544x1564_q90.png\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179540416292838038_18952633786b03b18357085.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：bilibili）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e4%be%af%e5%bb%ba%e6%b0%91/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">侯建民</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e4%bf%9e%e5%8f%af%e7%a8%8b/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">俞可程</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%a5%b3%e7%a5%9e%e9%85%8d%e5%b0%8d%e8%a8%88%e5%8a%832/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">女神配對計劃2</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3548164\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 23 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T04:49:55.643054+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1686,"images":7,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T03:22:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T06:24:49.939002+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T04:43:32.730750+00:00","content_hash":"61325a367600a6c72f132b8c64f17e2670fdf40327b7bc2a1785916de3369e1b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}